      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-03-29T14:26:01.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hey, folks! If you haven’t heard, tomorrow (Saturday, 30-Mar) is <a href=\"http://www.tabletopday.com/\">International TableTop Day</a>, a day of, well, you know… gaming.  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/grin.png?v=9\" title=\":grin:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":grin:\"></p>\n<p>If you have heard (and if you've read this far, then you have  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"> ), do you have any plans for the day? Playing games at home or going to an \"official\" event?</p>\n<p>Personally, I'm going to go to a local shop and see what they have going on. I'm not a big social person, so I probably won't stay long, but I'll definitely be going to check it out. I'll definitely be bringing SotM to share and enjoy. (I'm also going to take my Magic cards to sell, so we'll see how that goes…  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/open_mouth.png?v=9\" title=\":open_mouth:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":open_mouth:\"> )</p>\n<p>You?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:37:49.167Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
