      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "Hey, folks! If you haven&#39;t heard, tomorrow (Saturday, 30-Mar) is <a href=\"http://www.tabletopday.com/\">International TableTop Day</a>, a day of, well, you know... gaming.  :grin: \n\nIf you have heard (and if you&#39;ve read this far, then you have  :wink: ), do you have any plans for the day? Playing games at home or going to an &quot;official&quot; event?\n\nPersonally, I&#39;m going to go to a local shop and see what they have going on. I&#39;m not a big social person, so I probably won&#39;t stay long, but I&#39;ll definitely be going to check it out. I&#39;ll definitely be bringing SotM to share and enjoy.&nbsp;(I&#39;m also going to take my Magic cards to sell, so we&#39;ll see how that goes...  :open_mouth: )\n\nYou?",
