      "created_at": "2013-04-08T01:47:04.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>That's awesome.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=9\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\"></p>\n<p>I did get to spend some time playing Sentinels with some guys at the local store. One guy had bought it after only playing one game and the other had not played it but had watched, so it was a good opportunity to help them better understand the game and the options. Lots of fun!</p>",
